        <item>
            <title>Version 1.7.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 09:08:28 +0000</pubDate>
            <description>
**On-screen indicator**
- The floating recording indicator is now a small translucent orb instead of a wide pill —
  it shows your input level while recording, a spinner while transcribing, and a checkmark
  when the text lands.
- **Drag it anywhere.** Where you leave it is where it comes back, on whichever screen you
  put it. "Reset indicator position" in Settings › General puts it back at the bottom of the
  screen.
- The transcript itself no longer appears in the indicator — it goes where you're typing,
  which is where you were already looking. Errors still show their message in full.</description>
            <sparkle:version>22</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.7.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/davidbudac/hlas-releases/releases/download/v1.7.0/Hlas.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Ye/o54oG/eK025GZo5U3la2veUYzqp8I7OARpQxa5NEyvffAqzBm82i5P7RcX8kzsTgIprLOc8/TJ2bP1WqLAg==" length="16044418" />
