        <item>
            <title>Version 1.6.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 07:20:47 +0000</pubDate>
            <description>
**Updates**
- Hlas now checks for new versions on its own and offers the update when it finds one.
  Previously it only asked for permission to check on first launch, and did nothing at all
  if that prompt was declined or dismissed — so updates could be missed indefinitely unless
  you picked "Check for Updates…" from the menu-bar menu by hand.
- This fix only takes effect from this version onward: it is the 1.6.1 binary that knows to
  check, so 1.6.1 is the last update you may need to reach for the menu item to get.</description>
            <sparkle:version>21</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/davidbudac/hlas-releases/releases/download/v1.6.1/Hlas.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="b235kulU7sBAyP0VmdvwhRdxJ8ErmwtmPMICzgjxjVrWXsqqrG4Mw0Ira0NRFqfrPOawHJ4vI29drG7PGbbQBQ==" length="16032894" />
        </item>
        <item>
            <title>Version 1.6.0</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 07:08:04 +0000</pubDate>
            <description>
**Text**
- **AI cleanup** (Settings › Text, off by default) — rewrites the transcript on-device with
  **"S1-mini" by "Superwhisper"**: fillers removed, self-corrections resolved to what you
  landed on, punctuation and capitalization applied, and spoken numbers, dates, currency and
  email addresses written out. Four tones, optional bullet lists, optional email layout.
  English only; downloads a ~350 MB model on first use and runs entirely on your Mac.
- Filler-word removal and smart punctuation are disabled while AI cleanup is on — the model
  does both jobs, and running them together mangles its output. The personal dictionary still
  applies, before the model sees the text.

**Build**
- Xcode 26 and the separately-downloadable Metal toolchain
  (`xcodebuild -downloadComponent MetalToolchain`) are now required.</description>
            <sparkle:version>20</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/davidbudac/hlas-releases/releases/download/v1.6.0/Hlas.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="Tqti46BjaXwf1qiNx4xcY61Ahe4BwT7haJYCcnEVWb0f4ntxi5KWJnzArcAeVf5yjejSC6ow1COyNHU3aRRbAg==" length="16032544" />
