        <item>
            <title>Version 1.5.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 21 Aug 2026 20:42:16 +0000</pubDate>
            <description>
**Dictation**
- Optional floating on-screen indicator while recording/transcribing, with error feedback (Settings › General › Feedback; off by default)
- Press Esc to cancel a recording; Cancel button in the popover
- Optional sound cues (off by default); Launch at Login
- "Paste again" and tap-to-expand for the last transcript; Copy/Paste Last Transcription and Recording Mode in the menu-bar right-click menu
- Too-quiet takes now say so instead of silently doing nothing; errors are shown on the menu-bar icon

**Settings &amp; History**
- Settings reorganised into General, Transcription, Translation, Text, Meetings, Advanced; window keeps its size and position
- Whisper models show downloaded state and size, can be deleted or re-downloaded
- History: select, delete (Delete key / context menu), group by day, filter dictation vs meeting, Clear History; "Save transcripts to History" toggle and retention period
- Personal dictionary is an editable table
- Onboarding lets you choose Parakeet or Whisper and shows download progress

**Fixes &amp; privacy**
- Microphone recovers after sleep/wake (wake listener never fired before)
- Translation can no longer hang the app
- Dictionary replacements containing `$` or `\` no longer corrupt text; filler-word removal no longer deletes "like"/"actually"
- Dictation audio is deleted from disk after transcription; transcripts no longer written to the debug log or notifications
- Clipboard is restored faithfully (images, rich text), transcripts are hidden from clipboard managers, and paste/Enter only fire in the app you dictated from
- Meeting audio is kept until transcription succeeds, with a Retry button
- Remote server: no default address, unencrypted-connection warning, more reliable transfer and clearer errors</description>
            <sparkle:version>19</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
